    "searchCoverage": "Official NeverBounce REST API is GET https://api.neverbounce.com/v4.2/{path} with key query authentication. Current endpoint pages document v4.2; older auth samples still show v4. GET /account/info is the documented account probe used by the pinned credential validator and is used as healthcheck rather than billed single/check. GET /jobs/status and GET /jobs/results are documented reads. Job create/parse/start, CSV download, and billed single verification are omitted. HTTP 200 bodies may carry status other than success plus message; native bodyErrorPaths is [message] because status success would trip a non-empty-string path. Operator is ZoomInfo Technologies LLC in the United States. Dated incident search on 2026-09-13 found no qualifying NeverBounce platform compromise. Bounded coverage is not a breach-free claim.",
